The changes of h2oai/xgboost (branch h2oai, 2.1.4.dev1, on top of upstream
v2.1.4; see PORT.md there), applied to the ROCm 2.1.3 branch for the ROCm build:

- between-bin quantile cut points (src/common/quantile.cc, quantile.cu);
- XGBFI feature interactions (src/analysis/xgbfi.*, XGBoosterGetFeatureInteractions,
  Booster.get_feature_interactions);
- DAI_XGBOOST_AVOID_LOGGER (src/logging.cc);
- pred_leaf / pred_contribs / approx_contribs in the scikit-learn predict methods;
- ntree_limit in the dask scikit-learn predict/apply.

